# 03: a synth's MAIN page. The demo's pad track (Phazed, Phazed Strings), its macros turned while the song plays.
title A SYNTH'S MAIN PAGE
about A Phazed pad on its MAIN page while the song plays: hold A and push the stick to turn a macro, B puts it back in the middle.
caption SYNTH: MACROS
run --demo --view song
